%% Flow - publishing pipeline on merge to main
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GH as GitHub Repo
  participant CI as Actions Build Job
  participant Doc as Docusaurus Build
  participant I18n as i18n Locales
  participant Idx as Local Search Indexer
  participant Pages as GitHub Pages
  participant Smoke as Smoke Test

  GH->>CI: merge to main triggers deploy workflow
  CI->>Doc: run docusaurus build
  Doc->>I18n: build EN canonical locale
  Doc->>I18n: build HU locale with EN fallback
  I18n-->>Doc: locale bundles
  Doc->>Idx: generate build-time search index
  Idx-->>Doc: index files in artifact
  Doc-->>CI: static artifact in build directory
  CI->>Pages: upload and deploy artifact
  Pages-->>CI: deployment URL
  CI->>Smoke: fetch key routes on live site
  Smoke->>Smoke: check docs root - views root - search asset
  Smoke-->>CI: pass or fail
  CI-->>GH: report deploy status on commit
